  "body": "This PR is an attempt to add a way for web developers to revoke permission access to a paired HIDDevice. See https://github.com/WICG/webhid/issues/39\r\n\r\n```js\r\n// Request a HID device.\r\nconst [device] = await navigator.hid.requestDevice({ filters: [] });\r\n\r\n// Then later... revoke permission to the HID device.\r\nawait device.forget();\r\n```\r\n\r\n@nondebug Please have a look",
